.licenses/** -diff linguist-generated=true
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated bundles: `npm run build` output, committed so the action runs
# without a build step. `-merge` is the important one — two branches that both
# rebuild will otherwise textually auto-merge into a bundle neither side
# produced, which either silently drops half a change or ships something that
# was never built. With this, git raises a conflict and the resolution is to
# rebuild. `-diff` and linguist-generated keep 5 MB of bundle out of reviews.
dist/** -diff -merge linguist-generated=true
